Node ID=102 word carried
Text=<He takes this in the way he takes everything, without moving. Then he turns and says something short over his shoulder, and somewhere behind him a great deal of rock begins to shift.>  In daylight. And the same face.  <He looks back at you.>  You carried it whole. So.  <A younger troll brings up a piece of ore and the chief does not take it from him -- he lets him hand it to you himself, which is a thing you suspect has never happened in this room before.>  The first is not sold. The first is to show we can.
