Node ID=110 the field of them
Text=<Something goes out of him, briefly, and then comes back.>  You have seen it. Good. Then I do not have to say it.  <He does not look east, which you notice is deliberate.>  The one before me is out there. He is lying in the middle of the ones who came for the ore, because that is where he stopped them, and he has been lying there since. We have not gone to him.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why not? He is one of yours.
Go to node ID=111 why not
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That is your business, not mine.
