Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=111 why not
Text=Because a chief is counted by one who was not there.  <He says it the way a man says a thing he has said many times and never once liked.>  We were all there. Every one of us who is left was there and did not stop it. So none of us may stand over him and say the number. It must be somebody who owes him nothing.  <He looks at you, and it is the first time he has looked at you like that.>  You owe him nothing. You were not born when it happened. Go out to him, and stand, and count -- one for him and one for each of ours lying near him. That is all of it. Then come back and tell me it is done.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will go and count.
