Node ID=132 no price
Text=<He takes this the way he takes everything, and then does something you have not seen him do: he sits down. It is a slow business and the floor complains about it.>  No price.  <He looks at the rock between his feet.>  I have been chief since the day out there. Every day of it there has been a price. I do not know yet what the work is when there is not one.  <He glances up.>  I will find out. Go carefully on the stairs.
