Node ID=150 he sizes you up
Text=<He does look away first, but he takes his time about it, and you get the distinct impression it was a courtesy rather than a concession.>  You are not big. But you stand like something that has been hit and did not go over.  <He makes a low sound that is not quite approval.>  That is worth more than big. Big is common down here.
