Node ID=151 the bell
Text=<He looks at you for a long moment -- properly, the way he has not until now.>  ...Ah. Yes. I see it now.  <He does not say what he sees, and does not need to.>  Same word, near enough. I am not going to pretend that makes us the same thing -- you can walk up those stairs and I cannot.  <He turns back to the rock.>  But you did not have to be told what this place is. Every other one of you has to be told.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=<Let it lie.>
