Node ID=122 the ground says
Text=<The four trolls near him are not scattered. They are in a rough line and every one of them is facing the same direction, which is his. They were coming to him. They were still coming when it finished.>  <The thieves are further out and turned the other way -- one still has a bow in his hand with no arrow on the string, which means it ended faster than he could work. The dogs are furthest out of all and they are the only ones lying in a way that suggests they ran.>  <He was surrounded, and he did not move from where he stood, and his people did not reach him in time.>
