Node ID=123 who paid for this
Text=<Two wererats and two thieves, in the same party, on the same night, dying inside twenty feet of each other.>  <Those two do not work together. They have never worked together -- they are opposite ends of a war that has been running under this city for years, and everyone in the Sewers knows it.>  <Which leaves one arrangement that fits: somebody bought both halves separately, for the same night, and did not tell either of them the other was coming. And that somebody was not down here dying with them.>
