Node ID=40 parley
Text=<The troll's head comes round. Whatever it expected you to say, it was not that.>  ...Small one. Yes. Is in the deep.  <It shifts its weight, and for the first time it is not blocking you so much as thinking.>  Not my say. Not my rock to give. You want small one, you talk to chief. Chief is deep, past the water, at the far end where the rock goes red.  <It steps aside -- not far, and not comfortably.>  I say the word down. My people not touch you while you walk to him. That is all I give. Chief gives rest, or chief gives nothing.
